            "review_title": "Review at Bac Vi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Asian POV\nSingapore, Singapore17 contributions\n0\nExtensive menu but many were unavailable\nSep 2017 • Family\nWent to Bac Vi around 8pm after a long flight and wanted some good service and good food . Was told a few of my choices were unavailable including crab hot pot . I went there just to eat the crab hot pot and it was unavailable. It's like no more Big Mac in a Mcdonalds. \n\nVery disappointed with the visit and probably not go back again .\nRead more\nWritten September 9, 2017\nHuy N\nHi ! \n First We were so sorry about any inconvenients when u come to our restaurant . \n On that day you came , and orfer crab hot pot , but that day we served a lot of crab hotpot , we finhised all fresh crab , that why we coudnt served for your request .\nRead more\nWritten September 20, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
