            "review_title": "Review at Bac Vi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Tom V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Northern food. Southern service\nAug 2016 • Couples\nIf you enjoy the sour tastes of Vietnamese northern cuisine then this is the place for you! Authentic dishes and flavors. Even the yellow decor and dark wooden furniture gives you a HaNoi feel. \n\nOne thing that is not northern is the service. I mean it is really good! Not what you normally find in the north. \n\nNow the have expanded this place is good for groups.\nRead more\nWritten August 4, 2016\nbacvirestaurant\nMany thanks , im really appreciate about your opinions. Hope to serve u !\nWritten May 24, 2017\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
